Source: jags
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Remco van de Meent <remco@debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), libgtk1.2-dev, automake
Standards-Version: 3.6.1

Package: jags
Architecture: any
Depends: smbclient, samba-common, smbfs, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Just Another GTK+ Samba Client
 Jags is a Gtk+ based "windows network neighbourhood browser". The program
 parses the output from smbclient (part of the samba-package) and use this
 to display a graphic view of the network. This program does the parsing
 with help from shell- scripts.
